  "quality": "complete",
  "overview": {
    "description": "Hunter (or Young Hunter, German: JÃ¤ger) is a specialized German trick-taking game for four players. The game revolves entirely around the Jacks (the 'Youngs'), who act as both the 'Hunters' and the 'Prey'. Scoring is achieved not by winning tricks generally, but specifically by capturing or 'hitting' Jacks within tricks.",
    "category": "Trick-taking",
    "subCategory": "Trick-taking",
    "origin": "Germany (Saxony / Thuringia)",
    "originName": "Jäger (Junger Jäger)",
